# Services Component

Service abstraction layer providing lifecycle management and client detection for execution layer components.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Service interface pattern for consistent lifecycle management across execution components
- Client detection via string matching on node version strings
- Scheduled metadata refresh with exponential backoff on startup

## Important Constraints
- Services must implement Start/Stop/Ready/OnReady lifecycle methods
- Client detection supports Geth, Nethermind, Besu, Erigon, Reth, and EthereumJS